Error: Jet.UnclosedDelimiter: The `if` opened on line 9 is never closed
  --> Tests/UI/t03_unclosed.jet:9:22
    |
  9 |     if count > limit {
    |                      ^
  --> Tests/UI/t03_unclosed.jet:14:1
    |
 14 | }
    | ^ this `}` closes an outer block
 Why: The `}` on line 14 sits left of the `if` on line 9, so it closes an outer block and leaves the `if` without its own `}`
 Fix: Add `}` before line 12, the first line back at the indentation of the `if`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnclosedDelimiter
